{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他心里松快起来，甚至有些俏皮。先前他连忍住紧张都当成可靠的证明，所以此刻稍微放松下来，就尝到了一点自在的快乐。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他短暂体验到，快乐也能来自放松对自己的要求。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文对克制紧张的自我要求很明确，而本段的轻盈与亲切感能够支撑这种短暂松弛。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选1\",\n        \"候选9\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他心里发虚，连刚才那份坚定也像是勉强撑出来的。先前他把克制不安当作可靠的证明，所以连自己的镇定，也让他怀疑究竟是有把握还是在硬撑。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始怀疑，先前表现出的坚定也可能掺着勉强压住不安的成分。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"前文已把克制不安与可靠绑在一起，而本段也有将先前的昂扬理解为自我怀疑的听法。\",\n      \"uses\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b73b69df-5156-4fec-90e6-3f68d8479362", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T033412913567Z", "elapsed_seconds": 101.016, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T03:35:53.933825+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a23056a4ac919903af0518cc70bbaccb37804a1c4945a2edc50bde56802e8958", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614